!Name: p90thing
!C A c/3 period 90 puffer which produces a large still life.
!C This uses two period 45 rakes whose gliders impact into a period 21
!C frothing spaceship.  The period of the spaceship is modified by the
!C impacts to be compatible with the incoming glider streams.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
!
